{
  "body": {
    "content": [
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Phở gà is a clear, aromatic chicken noodle soup. ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "The key to a great ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "phở broth ",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "pho-broth"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "is charring the onion and ginger before simmering to give the soup its golden colour and smoky sweetness. ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "This recipe serves 4.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Season the broth with ",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "fish sauce ",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fish-sauce-viet"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "rather than salt. It adds a depth that plain salt cannot give.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "What you need",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        }
      },
      {
